    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3a6d9673c8b4636194f6f1c9ca38a954.poster.avif?t=1750312577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3a6d9673c8b4636194f6f1c9ca38a954.webm?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3a6d9673c8b4636194f6f1c9ca38a954.mp4?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Aleph is a short experimental creation, featuring four surreal vignettes, anchored by two elements: [Screen] and [Cube], illustrating a journey of future humans who gather fragmented relics of knowledge from bygone eras.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immerse yourself in a first-person cozy exploration journey with collecting elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > User-friendly operating tips with game controller supported, could make it an ideal starting point for newcomer to first-person games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy a leisurely adventure at your own pace, featuring minimal challenges and helpful hints, making it an ideal experience for all age groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ambient music throughout, reading excerpts from classic books</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A concise gaming experience, designed to be completed in a comfortable 45-minute session</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3d7a8459782358919e81bfcaf7188d56.poster.avif?t=1750312577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3d7a8459782358919e81bfcaf7188d56.webm?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3d7a8459782358919e81bfcaf7188d56.mp4?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial concept evolved from virtual exhibition spaces and has since been showcased in several exhibitions, where it drew inspiration and underwent further refinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/25f230a54b520e7da9d1b48c94c92df9.poster.avif?t=1750312577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/25f230a54b520e7da9d1b48c94c92df9.webm?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/25f230a54b520e7da9d1b48c94c92df9.mp4?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Credits]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Creator: Haoge Liu  / Tan Tan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Graphic Design: Lifan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Music&amp;Sound Design: suru</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3a6d9673c8b4636194f6f1c9ca38a954.poster.avif?t=1750312577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3a6d9673c8b4636194f6f1c9ca38a954.webm?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3a6d9673c8b4636194f6f1c9ca38a954.mp4?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Aleph is a short experimental creation, featuring four surreal vignettes, anchored by two elements: [Screen] and [Cube], illustrating a journey of future humans who gather fragmented relics of knowledge from bygone eras.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immerse yourself in a first-person cozy exploration journey with collecting elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > User-friendly operating tips with game controller supported, could make it an ideal starting point for newcomer to first-person games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy a leisurely adventure at your own pace, featuring minimal challenges and helpful hints, making it an ideal experience for all age groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ambient music throughout, reading excerpts from classic books</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A concise gaming experience, designed to be completed in a comfortable 45-minute session</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3d7a8459782358919e81bfcaf7188d56.poster.avif?t=1750312577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3d7a8459782358919e81bfcaf7188d56.webm?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/3d7a8459782358919e81bfcaf7188d56.mp4?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial concept evolved from virtual exhibition spaces and has since been showcased in several exhibitions, where it drew inspiration and underwent further refinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/25f230a54b520e7da9d1b48c94c92df9.poster.avif?t=1750312577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/25f230a54b520e7da9d1b48c94c92df9.webm?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387410/extras/25f230a54b520e7da9d1b48c94c92df9.mp4?t=1750312577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Credits]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Creator: Haoge Liu  / Tan Tan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Graphic Design: Lifan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Music&amp;Sound Design: suru</p>",
    "short_description": "Aleph is an enigmatic cube, a repository of human lore and simulacra. After the fall of human civilization, as a traveler, you depart from the space station and eventually reach the ruins of the dilapidated city, searching for scattered cubes to read the images and texts left behind by humanity.",
